  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DPHN-Promote DP law for children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The initiative of Hanoi Association of People with Disabilities (DPHANOI) is built upon the desire to promote the knowledge and awareness regarding the Law on Persons with Disabilities for children, (including children with disabilities) within North Tu Liem and Dong Anh districts, Hanoi. Throughout the series of communication activities &#x201c;The image of people with disabilities from the perspective of children&#x201d;, the project aims to disseminate legal knowledge and enhance the understanding of children regarding people with disabilities. Furthermore, DPHANOI&#x2019;s objective is to provide legal consultation about the rights of people with disabilities, contributing to the enhancement of people&#x2019;s rights. Last but not least, the project will also target to propagate to people and community surround, specifically beneficiaries, local governmental agencies and people surround to further spread out the influences on every related stakeholder in embracing and ensuring the rights for people with disabilities, especiallychildren. Overall, the results expected to achieve are: 6,000 children participate in project activities; 1,000 people participated in the online game &#x201c;Learn about the Law of People with Disabilities&#x201d;; 1,000 children were instructed to draw pictures on the project&apos;s theme; 400 messages through pictures of children participating in the drawing contest on the topic &quot; The image of people with disabilities from the perspective of children &quot;are exhibited.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Union</narrative>
  </participating-org>
  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hanoi Association of People with Disabilities (DP Hanoi)
Purpose: gathering, uniting, improving the capacity of people with disabilities, protect rights and legitimate interests of members; encouraging, creating opportunities for people with disabilities to rise above the difficulties in order to become better persons, fully and equally integrated into society, striving for &quot;Inclusive societywithout barrier and for the rights of people with disabilities #.
Vision: In the near future, Vietnamese disabled people will integrate fully into every area of social life.
Mission: Promoting the implementation of rights of people with disabilities.
Organizational network of DP Hanoi (as of November 2017): 47 member organizations with more than 10,000 people with disabilities, including: 30 associations of people with disabilities on districts / communes level and 85 associations on communes / wards level, 100 branches of people with disabilities association under districts/commnues&apos; associations; 17 groups, clubs, centers
Main areas of activity: Deveoping towards sustainability, transparency and accountability; Promoting the implementation of the United Nations Convention on theRights of Persons with Disabilities, the Persons with Disabilities law and relevant legal documents to support people with disabilities; Raising awareness and capacity for people with disabilities; Taking care of the material and spiritual life of members; Conducting communication activities to raise public awareness about disability;International cooperation, sponsorship mobilization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hanoi Association of People with</narrative>
